n-ghost ext\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=25.38638,55.550659\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m1 6 7-3 8 3 7-3v15l-7 3-8-3-7 3z\"></path><path d=\"M8 3v15M16 6v15\"></path></svg>الخريطة</a></span></li><li><button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"cm-card\" data-i=\"2\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"cm-n numx\">3</span><span class=\"cm-b\"><b>فرع منطقة الظفرة</b><small>تقاطع شارع الديوان مع شارع محمد خلف المزروعي، مدينة زايد، المنطقة الغربية 2، الظفرة، أبوظبي، الإمارات العربية المتحدة</small><span class=\"cm-meta\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\">+971 2 499 9000</bdi> · <span class=\"numx\">113</span> كم عن المقر الرئيسي (خط مستقيم)</span></span></button><span class=\"cm-acts\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"tel:+97124999000\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z\"></path></svg>اتصال</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost ext\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=23.65389,53.701619\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m1 6 7-3 8 3 7-3v15l-7 3-8-3-7 3z\"></path><path d=\"M8 3v15M16 6v15\"></path></svg>الخريطة</a></span></li></ol></div></div>"}, {"id": "s6", "cls": "up-cta-wrap", "tag": "section", "kicker": "", "title": "", "lead": "", "actions": [], "html": "<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"up-cta\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"up-cta-ros\" focusable=\"false\" viewbox=\"0 0 240 240\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".9\"><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"112\"></circle><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"104\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 5\"></circle><polygon points=\"120,20 220,120 120,220 20,120\"></polygon><polygon points=\"49.3,49.3 190.7,49.3 190.7,190.7 49.3,190.7\"></polygon><polygon class=\"r-star\" points=\"120.0,20.0 143.7,62.7 190.7,49.3 177.3,96.3 220.0,120.0 177.3,143.7 190.7,190.7 143.7,177.3 120.0,220.0 96.3,177.3 49.3,190.7 62.7,143.7 20.0,120.0 62.7,96.3 49.3,49.3 96.3,62.7\"></polygon><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"44\"></circle><polygon points=\"164.0,120.0 151.1,151.1 120.0,164.0 88.9,151.1 76.0,120.0 88.9,88.9 120.0,76.0 151.1,88.9\"></polygon></g></svg><div><h2>هل أنت مستعد للانضمام؟</h2><p>استكشف البرامج الأكاديمية وابدأ رحلة التقديم.</p></div><div class=\"up-cta-b\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-xl\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/apply.html\">بادر بالتقديم</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost-light\" href=\"/mbzuhweb/v12/programs.html\">استكشف البرامج</a></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "s7", "cls": "container", "tag": "div", "kicker": "", "title": "", "lead": "", "actions": [], "html": "<p class=\"up-src\">المصدر: الموقع الرسمي (https://www.mbzuh.ac.ae/ar/about-university) — نُسخ مباشرة بتاريخ 6 أكتوبر 2026</p>"}], "scripts": ["site", "pages", "v6"], "css": ["fonts.css", "site.css", "pages.css", "v4.css", "v5.css", "v6.css"], "json": []}